  "description": "<div style=\"font-family:Poppins;\"><div><p style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;color:inherit;margin:0 0 10px 0;text-align:justify;\">Our EUR/USD subscriptions for telegram signals and platforms automation are designed to provide traders with comprehensive educational resources and highly accurate forex signals for the world's most traded currency pair. Our signals are generated through advanced technical analysis and market research, delivering real-time trading opportunities directly to your Telegram account.</p><p style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;color:inherit;margin:0 0 10px 0;text-align:justify;\">Premium Subscription focuses on helping traders learn how to interpret and execute high-quality trading signals manually, developing a deeper understanding of market dynamics and price action. Each signal provides clear entry points, stop-loss levels, and take-profit targets, allowing traders to understand the reasoning behind each trade setup and build their market analysis skills.</p><p style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;color:inherit;margin:0 0 10px 0;text-align:justify;\">Gold Subscription emphasizes automation technology, allowing you to learn how professional automated trading systems execute positions without manual intervention. The integration with cTrader, MT4, and MT5 platforms demonstrates practical applications of algorithmic trading strategies. Through this service, traders gain educational insights into risk management by customizing stop-loss parameters based on position direction, understanding volume allocation strategies for different market conditions, and learning how to filter signals using robot-specific criteria.</p><p style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;color:inherit;margin:0 0 10px 0;text-align:justify;\">Both subscriptions serve as educational tools for traders looking to master forex trading while benefiting from our team's market analysis and signal generation expertise. With 6+ years of proven track record, traders can study real-world examples of trade setups, understand the relationship between signal accuracy and trading performance, and gradually develop the confidence and knowledge needed for independent trading success in EUR/USD price movements.</p><h2 style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;color:inherit;margin:20px 0 10px 0;text-align:left;\">EUR/USD subscriptions for telegram signals and platforms automation includes the following features:</h2><ul style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;color:inherit;margin:10px 0;list-style-type:disc;text-align:justify;\"><li style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;color:inherit;margin-bottom:8px;text-align:justify;\"><h2 style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;color:inherit;text-align:justify;\">Real-time* statistics for all signals</h2></li><li style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;color:inherit;margin-bottom:8px;text-align:justify;\"><h2 style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;color:inherit;text-align:justify;\">Providing instant signals on a private Telegram channel</h2></li><li style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;color:inherit;margin-bottom:8px;text-align:justify;\"><h2 style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;color:inherit;text-align:justify;\">Use your trading application to manually execute the signals</h2></li><li style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;color:inherit;margin-bottom:8px;text-align:justify;\"><h2 style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;color:inherit;text-align:justify;\">Ctrader/MT4/MT5 robot automatically copying all signals</h2></li><li style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;color:inherit;margin-bottom:8px;text-align:justify;\"><h2 style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;color:inherit;text-align:justify;\">Ability to set your Stop Loss based on the direction of the position (Buy or Sell)</h2></li><li style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;color:inherit;margin-bottom:8px;text-align:justify;\"><h2 style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;color:inherit;text-align:justify;\">Ability to set your volume order based on the direction of the position (Buy or Sell)</h2></li><li style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;color:inherit;margin-bottom:8px;text-align:justify;\"><h2 style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;color:inherit;text-align:justify;\">Ability to exclude copying signals from specific robotnames. Those robotnames signals will be excluded from automation.</h2></li><li style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;color:inherit;margin-bottom:8px;text-align:justify;\"><h2 style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;color:inherit;text-align:justify;\">Ability to include copying signals from specific robotnames. From only those robotnames signals will be automatically executed.</h2></li></ul></div></div>",
